{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4cZMWam6rQTLT6QTqE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old and weathered.*\n\n*The key slides into the lock with a satisfying click.*\n\n*Tumblers turn. Ancient mechanisms groan.*\n\n*I swing open slowly, hinges whispering secrets of every soul who has passed through before you.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor stretching into warm amber light, the faint scent of old books and candle wax drifting through.*\n\n*You may enter.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":107,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}